fn k_world_table() []u8 {
    return "air conditioner\tcools rooms, summer, cold air\tblows hot air, heats room, broken\tfact=an air conditioner cools rooms\nalarm clock\twakes you, ringing, morning\tsilent, didn't ring, snoozed forever\tfact=an alarm clock wakes you by ringing\nanti-gravity\tfloat, weightless, space\tput down, set down, table\tfact=anti-gravity makes things float\natm\tcash, withdraw, money\tdispenses soup, gives hugs, eats cards\tfact=an atm dispenses cash\nbacon\tpig, breakfast, crispy\tgrows on trees, tofu, from cows\tfact=bacon comes from pigs\nbanana\tyellow, peel, fruit\tblue, neon, square\tfact=bananas are yellow when ripe\nbed\tsleep, mattress, night\tfor standing, made of stone, awake\tfact=a bed is for sleeping\nbicycle\ttwo wheels, pedals\tone wheel, no pedals, four wheels\tfact=a bicycle has two wheels and pedals\nbirthday\tonce a year, cake, candles\ttwice a year, every month, no cake\tfact=a birthday comes once a year\nblood\tred, circulates, veins\tblue, green, still\tfact=blood is red and circulates\nbrain\tthinks, head, mind\tin the foot, doesn't think, tiny\tfact=the brain does the thinking\nbreakfast\tmorning, eggs, first meal\tat midnight, dinner food, skipped\tfact=breakfast is the morning meal\nbridge\tcrosses, river, span\tgoes nowhere, underwater, dead end\tfact=a bridge crosses a gap\nbutter\tdairy, melts, spread\tmade of wood, never melts, chunky\tfact=butter is dairy and melts\ncalculator\tmath, numbers, compute\twrong answers, guesses, spells\tfact=a calculator does math\ncamera\tphotos, lens, capture\ttakes naps, paints, draws\tfact=a camera captures images\ncar\tdrives, roads, wheels\tflies, swims, no wheels\tfact=a car drives on roads\ncash\tpaper money, physical\tgrows on trees, free, digital only\tfact=cash is physical money\ncat\tmeows, purrs, independent\tbarks, does taxes, obedient\tfact=a cat meows\ncereal\tbreakfast, milk, bowl\tdinner, dry with soda, no milk\tfact=cereal is eaten with milk at breakfast\ncheese\tdairy, milk, aged\tgrows on trees, plastic, meat\tfact=cheese is made from milk\nchicken\tbird, eggs, clucks\tlays square eggs, mammal, roars\tfact=a chicken is a bird that lays eggs\nchurch\tworship, pray, sunday\tnightclub, casino, shopping\tfact=a church is for worship\ncloud\tsky, vapor, white\tcotton candy, on the ground, solid\tfact=a cloud is water vapor in the sky\ncoin\theads, tails, flip\tthree sides, lands on edge, blank\tfact=a coin has heads and tails\ncomputer\tprocesses, programs, data\tdisobeys, daydreams, feelings\tfact=a computer follows instructions\ncow\tmoos, milk, pasture\tbarks, lays eggs, chocolate milk\tfact=a cow moos and gives milk\ncrocodile\treptile, teeth, swamp\tvegetarian, cuddly, pet\tfact=a crocodile is a dangerous reptile\ndentist\tteeth, drill, cavity\truins teeth, afraid of teeth, no license\tfact=a dentist fixes teeth\ndiamond\thard, gem, sparkle\tsoft, scratches easily, glass\tfact=a diamond is very hard\ndiet\teat less, healthy, lose weight\teat more, cake diet, gain\tfact=a diet means eating less\ndoctor\theals, medicine, hospital\tmakes sick, prescribes candy, google\tfact=a doctor treats illness\ndonut\tsweet, ring, fried\thealthy, square, baked\tfact=a donut is a sweet fried ring\ndragon\tfire, mythical, scales\tbreathes ice, real, fire extinguisher\tfact=a dragon breathes fire\nearthquake\tshakes, ground, fault\tscheduled, gentle, massage\tfact=an earthquake shakes the ground\negg\tfragile, shell, chicken\tunbreakable, bouncy, square\tfact=an egg is fragile\nelectric company\tbill, utility, gas company, water company\tafter me, chasing, owe\tfact=utility companies send bills\nelectricity\twires, power, current\truns on water, free, wireless\tfact=electricity flows through wires\nemail\tinstant, inbox, send\ttakes weeks, horse, paper\tfact=email is instant\nescalator\tmoving stairs, mall\tnot moving, broken, stairs\tfact=an escalator is moving stairs\nfeather\tlight, bird, soft\theavy, sinks, stone\tfact=a feather is light\nfire\thot, burns, flames\tcold fire, doesn't burn, wet\tfact=fire is hot and burns\nfish\tswims, water, gills\tdrowns, afraid of water, walks\tfact=a fish swims in water\nfloor\twalk, ground, tiles\tceiling, lava, walls\tfact=a floor is walked on\nfootball\toval, thrown, touchdown\tperfectly round, kicked only, no hands\tfact=a football is oval\nfrench fries\tfried, potatoes, salty\tbaked, healthy, raw\tfact=french fries are fried potatoes\nfrog\tjumps, croaks, pond\twalks, silent, desert\tfact=a frog jumps and croaks\nfront camera\tselfie, facetime, video call\tfaces away, rear-facing, blind\tfact=the front camera faces the user\nfuneral\tmourning, sad, burial\tparty, celebration, laughter\tfact=a funeral is for mourning\ngarden\tplants, grows, flowers\tconcrete, weeds only, desert\tfact=a garden grows plants\ngazpacho\tcold soup, tomato, chilled\tserved hot, heated, steaming\tfact=gazpacho is served cold\ngift\tgiven, wrapped, free\tinvoiced, taken back, receipt demanded\tfact=a gift is given freely\nglass\ttransparent, fragile, window\topaque, unbreakable, wood\tfact=glass is transparent and fragile\nglove\thands, fingers, warm\tfeet, one finger, summer\tfact=a glove covers the hand\ngold\tprecious, metal, shiny\tcheap, rusts, dull\tfact=gold is a precious metal\ngrass\tgreen, lawn, grows\tblue, doesn't grow, plastic\tfact=grass is green and grows\nguitar\tstrings, strum, music\tdrums, no strings, silent\tfact=a guitar has strings\nhammer\tnails, hits, tool\tscrews, rubber, gentle taps\tfact=a hammer drives nails\nhat\thead, worn, cap\tworn on foot, keeps feet warm, bowl\tfact=a hat is worn on the head\nheart\tpumps, blood, beats\tpumps air, beats backwards, stops\tfact=the heart pumps blood\nhelmet\tprotects head, safety\tprotects feet, paper, decoration\tfact=a helmet protects the head\nhoney\tsweet, bees, hive\tsalty, made by bears, maple\tfact=bees make honey\nhospital\theals, sick, doctors\tcasino, hotel, makes sick\tfact=a hospital treats the sick\nhotel\tguests, sleep, rooms\tp